<title>USA: IPO FILING - Vista Medical Technologies Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Vista Medical Technologies Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Vista Medical Technologies Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			VMTI.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-$13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,718,903</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter	     Goldman Sachs &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  525,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Vista, based in Carlsbad, Calif., develops, manufactures and intends to market proprietary visualization and information systems that enable minimally invasive surgical solutions in cardiothoracic, head, neck and spine and other selected microsurgical procedures.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To fund product introductions, sales and marketing activities, reasearch and development, acquisition of capital equipment for manufacturing scale-up and for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Sales		   $2,244	     $1,719</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)   ($7,439)	  ($3,274)</p>
